          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s06_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s06_c3_running_with_scissors_lifts_spatiote",
          "text": "Running-with-scissors lifts this into a spatiotemporal, partially observed setting: players move on a grid, collect rock, paper, and scissors resources, and must infer a hidden opponent inventory from a narrow first-person view.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
