        {
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s07_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c3_crucially_gain_relative_population_p",
          "text": "Crucially, the gain in relative population performance coincides with growth in the effective population size, from five up to eight distinct policies, showing that the improvement comes from genuinely discovering new strategies rather than overfitting.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
