          "chunk_id": "s08_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s08_c3_but_against_competent_mixtures_over",
          "text": "But against competent mixtures over four or seven policies, the randomly initialized agent fails outright despite prolonged training, while the transferred agent readily discovers the exploit.",
